    "tabs_abdb7r": {
      "type": "tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_x9Nxzp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does 'Flavored Air' taste like?",
            "content": "<p>Imagine the difference between biting into a fresh sprig of mint versus chewing sugary gum. Your bad habit coats your mouth with heavy, chemical sweeteners (like \"sticky soda\"). </p><p>Lio delivers a crisp, natural aromatic sensation. It is not an overpowering sugar-bomb; it is a refreshing, sensory \"shock\" designed to distract your brain from cravings without the guilt.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_BAgGD7": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does Lio actually work?",
            "content": "<p>Breaking a repetitive habit is hard because your hands and brain miss the ritual. Lio works by satisfying that \"loop\" in three ways:</p><ol><li><strong>The Resistance:</strong> Precision airflow mimics the physical drag sensation you are used to, engaging your deep breathing.</li><li><strong>The Ritual:</strong> The device keeps your hands busy and satisfies the oral fixation.</li><li><strong>The Sensory Shift:</strong> Natural aromatherapy distracts the brain and provides a moment of calm.</li></ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_rgGNhY": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Lio safe to use?",
            "content": "<p>Lio is built on a philosophy of \"Safety by Subtraction.\" We removed the electronics, the heating elements, harmful ingredients, and the batteries. You are simply inhaling Flavored Air passed through natural food-grade essential oils.</p><p><br/><em>Note:</em> All our products are produced under strict management in the Netherlands and Europe to ensure the highest quality standards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_QNHrUf": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How often can I use it?",
            "content": "<p>As often as you need a break. Because Lio contains <strong>zero calories and zero stimulants</strong>, there is no limit. You can use it throughout the day to find focus or calm tension without worrying about \"overdoing it\".</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_AJbEiq": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does a Flavor Core last?",
            "content": "<p>Each core is designed for 2–4 days of frequent use.</p><p><br/><em>Pro Tip:</em> With the <strong>Lio Gen 2</strong>, you can extend the life of your core by twisting the airflow dial completely closed when you aren't using it to lock in the aroma.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_x9Nxzp",
        "tab_BAgGD7",
